WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
On I go, searching for...

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
The past that was stolen from me

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Wandering on through...

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
This city, so strange to see

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Choked by the scent of flames that seems to...

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Cling to me

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Didn't we both say our goodbyes...

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
And go our separate ways?

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
When you see the face of hell...

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
It will squeeze your heart dry

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Fighting on seems so pointless now

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
If this must be my fate...

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Then I'll make my mind up now

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
So, please, won't you just leave me be...

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Another day

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Oh, will tomorrow hold something new to see?

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:05.790
Where am I?

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:11.080
Two People

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:26.630
Fyana...

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:48.000
The last thing I remember is escaping
the jungles of Kummen with Fyana.

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:50.420
There's no doubt about that.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:57.000
But, right after that, something grabbed us.

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:37.130
Where are we?

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:38.670
I don't know.

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:47.830
How long were we unconscious?

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:49.210
Good question.

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:55.630
I don't remember anything past
when we ran into that light.

00:06:53.630 --> 00:06:54.830
Do you hear something?

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:33.500
It's a ship. I think we're onboard a warship.

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:35.830
That's what that light was.

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:04.380
There's no sign of any people onboard.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:06.500
Not one.

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:36.170
It's just a decontamination lamp.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.210
There's really nobody here.

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:53.130
It looks abandoned.

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:03.130
Just...the two of us.

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:05.330
Yeah.

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:18.040
Let's look around a little more.

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:03.790
I'd like to stop playing hide and seek now.

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:28.170
Nav and communication systems are locked.

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:29.540
Manual override isn't working.

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:33.170
Yeah, we're flying on autopilot.

00:10:42.170 --> 00:10:44.830
What's this all about?

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:47.500
We're the only people on this ship!

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:58.210
I wonder where we're going?

00:10:58.210 --> 00:10:59.710
I should have the answer soon.

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:10.580
It's denying access to the data.

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:11.960
But why?

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:15.630
Who brought us on board this ship?

00:11:19.830 --> 00:11:21.250
Access denied.

00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:22.830
Well, where are we?

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:32.710
According to this, we're entering
Balarant-controlled space.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:35.420
I wonder if there are any planets nearby?

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:44.330
There's nothing around here.

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:46.630
Who's done this, and why?

00:11:46.630 --> 00:11:48.630
What are they going to do to us?

00:12:26.630 --> 00:12:31.080
There's a wine locker down below
and all the supplies we could ever ask for.

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:34.170
About the only thing we can do now is enjoy it.

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:36.250
Shall we?

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:39.670
How about a toast?

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:41.130
To what?

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:43.580
To this ship, on its unknown course.

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:46.710
To the people who brought us here.

00:12:46.710 --> 00:12:47.790
And...

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:48.830
And?

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:52.000
To us.

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:03.750
What's wrong? Are you okay?

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:06.790
Do you feel sick?

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:13.250
Why do people like to drink this stuff so much?!

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:16.790
Wait, you... You don't mean...?!

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:20.250
Yeah. I've never drunk any alcohol before.

00:13:30.170 --> 00:13:32.830
It's quiet. So quiet.

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:36.330
Where do you suppose this ship is taking us?

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:38.960
No matter where it goes, I'll always be with you.

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:35.080
Take that way!

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:59.290
The Red Shoulders...

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:43.500
I am a Red Shoulder...

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:44.920
I am...

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:45.960
Stop it!

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:47.210
STOP IT!

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:05.920
The Red Shoulders.

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:07.330
You know about them?

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:09.330
It was in my programming.

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:10.750
The Blood Sucker Battalion.

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:15.130
Melkian Strategic Armored Trooper
Special Operations Corps X-1.

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:31.380
That's monstrous! Monstrous!

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:33.540
Killing noncombatants!

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:38.000
You were attached to that battalion, Chirico?

00:16:38.250 --> 00:16:39.790
Chirico...

00:16:40.420 --> 00:16:42.830
Why is there a data file
on the Red Shoulders here?

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:47.920
Somebody wants me to remember
a past I want to forget.

00:16:48.380 --> 00:16:50.540
A past I need to forget!

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:00.790
These bloodthirsty animals...

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:03.130
The Blood Sucker Battalion. The Red Shoulders.

00:17:19.420 --> 00:17:22.130
It just stopped in the middle.

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:37.210
What did seeing that video
make her want to say?

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:40.630
Of course. That I was a vampire,
a heartless butcher.

00:17:41.670 --> 00:17:46.250
I know. There's nothing in me for anyone to love.

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:55.500
I pity you so, my darling.

00:17:56.040 --> 00:17:59.040
As much as my being a PS hurts me,

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:03.630
the pain the past inflicts
on your heart is far worse.

00:18:04.170 --> 00:18:09.460
I know. Love was something
that had no place in my heart.

00:18:09.960 --> 00:18:16.460
No matter what your past is,
my feelings won't change.

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:18.420
But, for now...

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:39.670
For now, there's nothing I can do
to ease the pain inside him.

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:50.750
Why would someone try to dredge up
those old memories?

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:53.000
Who set up that video to play?!

00:19:13.500 --> 00:19:15.920
What are they trying to do to me?

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:20.710
This is Balarant patrol group 7.

00:19:20.710 --> 00:19:22.540
You have violated our territorial space!

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:24.420
Stop your ship at once!

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:27.540
You are ordered to stop at once!

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:30.080
Failure to comply will force us
to open fire on you!

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:37.380
That was a warning shot!

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:49.460
It looks like they want to capture this ship.

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:53.080
Chirico! You're not planning to
fight them alone, are you?!

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:55.290
To break the cease-fire?!

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:56.630
Chirico!

00:19:58.080 --> 00:20:00.080
What else could I do?

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:03.500
I knew what would happen
if the Balarant captured a PS.

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:08.380
Besides, I'm a Red Shoulder. A man born to fight.

00:22:04.580 --> 00:22:05.920
The only place...

00:22:06.380 --> 00:22:07.920
I feel at home...

00:22:08.380 --> 00:22:10.170
is in battle!

00:22:21.790 --> 00:22:26.500
Fyana and I had escaped the jungle
to find a new world.

00:22:27.000 --> 00:22:30.670
And here I was, forced to confront old wounds.

00:22:31.380 --> 00:22:34.500
Trapped in an unknown ship
headed God knows where...

00:22:35.040 --> 00:22:40.540
enduring both old wounds
and having to fight the Balarant.

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:44.750
And the woman I loved,
who I was fighting to protect,

00:22:45.330 --> 00:22:51.460
seemed to be drifting further away
with each passing second.

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.710
Next Episode

00:22:56.290 --> 00:22:59.130
Shots from the past pierce a man's soul.

00:22:59.670 --> 00:23:03.170
The wounded soul wanders through darkness
in pursuit of its enemies.

00:23:04.040 --> 00:23:05.710
The light of the Red Shoulder.

00:23:05.880 --> 00:23:07.540
The darkness of the Red Shoulder.

00:23:07.710 --> 00:23:09.460
The pain of the Red Shoulder.

00:23:10.290 --> 00:23:13.210
The past, once thought to be dead and buried

00:23:13.210 --> 00:23:15.920
is now unearthed by this
new mystery surrounding Chirico.

00:23:16.710 --> 00:23:18.710
Next time, "Phantasm"

00:23:18.790 --> 00:23:24.290
Phantasm

00:23:18.790 --> 00:23:24.290
Next Time

00:23:19.420 --> 00:23:22.750
A wounded soul seeks comfort within battle.

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:46.000
Whenever I'm feeling lonely

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:49.540
Whenever I'm feeling sad

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:55.920
I can always see you floating in my mind

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:59.960
Whenever I'm alone

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:03.380
Whenever I long for you

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:09.630
I can always feel you inside my heart

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:13.130
No matter how far apart we may go

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:16.540
No matter if my path should part from yours

00:24:16.710 --> 00:24:23.040
The memories of you seem to shine inside my heart...

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:29.380
Brighter than any other light...
